{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628460/extras/Idle.gif?t=1743704573\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Rise. Conquer. Rule.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Command your army in a tactical, turn-based strategy game where every move matters. Battle across an 8x8 grid, blending classic chess-like mechanics with roguelike progression.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Demo Mode</strong> \u2013 In this short demo, you'll face numerous enemies and familiarize yourself with the basics of the game mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survival and Story modes will be available in full version of the game</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Strategic Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628460/extras/change.gif?t=1743704573\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Grid-Based Battles</strong> \u2013 Position and maneuver your units wisely to outplay opponent. <br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Evolving Challenges</strong> \u2013 Each victory reshapes the battlefield with new obstacles and enemies. <br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Tactical Upgrades</strong> \u2013 Earn cards to power up your army and recruit unique units.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>You are the king</strong> \u2013 By all means, protect the king! If the king is lost, the game is over!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Meet Your Units</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628460/extras/attack.gif?t=1743704573\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udd39Knight, Mage,\u00a0Archer</strong>\u00a0and many more classic fantasy unit types, each with its own set of abilities helping you out in your journey!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3628460?t=1743704573","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3628460?t=1743704573","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628460/1f0255a43418d5c7b958cccca00bf92115369664/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743704573","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628460/1f0255a43418d5c7b958cccca00bf92115369664/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743704573","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628460/extras/Idle.gif?t=1743704573\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Rise. Conquer. Rule.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Command your army in a tactical, turn-based strategy game where every move matters. Battle across an 8x8 grid, blending classic chess-like mechanics with roguelike progression.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Demo Mode</strong> \u2013 In this short demo, you'll face numerous enemies and familiarize yourself with the basics of the game mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survival and Story modes will be available in full version of the game</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Strategic Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628460/extras/change.gif?t=1743704573\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Grid-Based Battles</strong> \u2013 Position and maneuver your units wisely to outplay opponent. <br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Evolving Challenges</strong> \u2013 Each victory reshapes the b